かご無理はなさらず、ご検討のほどよろしくお願い致します…！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@trnoao/works/103", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac8d2b3/uploads/origins/2fab9b8f-166b-4275-bd06-1b21df5375e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34aa059aafeacb8ff5beebf17969fc89", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6ac8d2b3/uploads/origins/2fab9b8f-166b-4275-bd06-1b21df5375e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34aa059aafeacb8ff5beebf17969fc89, https://si.imgix.net/6ac8d2b3/uploads/origins/2fab9b8f-166b-4275-bd06-1b21df5375e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cf3adde2a26a2609039baec33b4cf08 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6ac8d2b3/uploads/origins/2fab9b8f-166b-4275-bd06-1b21df5375e8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09b95c18b860dae7f454994c178bbf18 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I love your art style. I’d like to request a male character with reddish-brown hair; he’s an actor. Please draw him from the front (sitting or standing is fine) with a stylish, magazine-cover vibe and a teddy bear beside him. Personality: calm and proud outside, shy and gentle inside.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@trnoao/works/102", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f592939a/uploads/origins/ea07759d-819e-4856-9b2a-0e7afa07678a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3559998aff07756367d57f98167d0f9e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f592939a/uploads/origins/ea07759d-819e-4856-9b2a-0e7afa07678a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3559998aff07756367d57f98167d0f9e, https://si.imgix.net/f592939a/uploads/origins/ea07759d-819e-4856-9b2a-0e7afa07678a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=907350db63f25cb0d8c1495606f8d303 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f592939a/uploads/origins/ea07759d-819e-4856-9b2a-0e7afa07678a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=479b1f107bf234912de3a66b111c5035 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "They will be characters I played in a TRPG, and I would like to have illustrations of the four of them.\nI will attach reference material regarding the appearance.\n\n🩷Stark\nMale/Height 174cm/26years old\nEnergetic, natural.\nPersonal clothes are American casual style, such as half pants and caps\n\n❤️ Irene\nFemale / Height 164cm / 36 years old\nShe is a \"wha-wha-wha\" type of older lady.\nHer private clothes are neat and less revealing.\n\n💚Luka\nMale / Height 187cm / 29 years old\nDowner type. His clothes are simple and monotone.\n\n🧡Angelica(Angie)\nFemale/150cm/39years old\nShe is cheerful and pulls people around her.\nShe wears natural clothes such as one-piece dresses and long skirts.\n\nThank you for your consideration.\n\nhttps://photos.app.goo.gl/x4Av99UWXvCs8eJq8", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@trnoao/works/101", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/67b8bd1c/uploads/origins/63ebfdaf-83a8-40d4-a4ae-b23fc97c9140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfb660c2e6ef46afbd4cf31fe21c755b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/67b8bd1c/uploads/origins/63ebfdaf-83a8-40d4-a4ae-b23fc97c9140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dfb660c2e6ef46afbd4cf31fe21c755b, https://si.imgix.net/67b8bd1c/uploads/origins/63ebfdaf-83a8-40d4-a4ae-b23fc97c9140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be0a2c180835674f8b91e74f5ebb755d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/67b8bd1c/uploads/origins/63ebfdaf-83a8-40d4-a4ae-b23fc97c9140?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37fc3ebba740313efd1b19bc23b58ade 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Request Description:\nI would like to see a male character seen from the side!\nOther than that, 